sequenceDiagram
    participant Konflux as Konflux Build
    participant InitC as Init Container<br/>(odh-pipelines-components)
    participant PVC as Shared PVC<br/>/config/managed-pipelines/
    participant KFP as KFP API Server
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGX as OGX API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Milvus as Milvus<br/>19530/TCP gRPC
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Konflux,KFP: Flow 1: Managed Pipeline Registration
    Konflux->>InitC: Build image (compile managed YAML)
    InitC->>PVC: Copy managed-pipelines.json + YAML
    KFP->>PVC: Read pipeline manifests
    Note over KFP: Auto-registers managed pipelines

    Note over KFP,S3: Flow 2: AutoML Training Pipeline
    KFP->>S3: 1. Data loader fetches training data<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
    Note over KFP: 2. Data loader writes to Workspace PVC
    Note over KFP: 3. AutoGluon training reads from PVC
    KFP->>KFP: 4. Store artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token

    Note over KFP,OGX: Flow 3: AutoRAG Optimization Pipeline
    KFP->>S3: 1. documents_discovery<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
    Note over KFP: 2. text_extraction (embedded docling models)
    KFP->>OGX: 3. documents_indexing<br/>HTTPS/443, API key
    KFP->>OGX: 4. rag_templates_optimization<br/>HTTPS/443, API key

    Note over KFP,MR: Flow 4: LLM Fine-tuning Pipeline
    KFP->>HF: 1. dataset_download<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    KFP->>S3: 1. (alt) dataset from S3<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
    Note over KFP: 2. training via ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA Token
    KFP->>KServe: 3. evaluation<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
    KFP->>MR: 4. model_registry registration<br/>HTTPS/443, Bearer Token
